  _webcamSourceTexture: {fileID: 0}
  _captureWidth: 512
  _captureHeight: 384
  _visionPrompt: "Describe the person on camera in 3-4 sentences. Include: estimated
    age range, gender, hair, clothing, accessories (glasses, jewelry, watch), facial
    hair, visible tattoos or scars. Describe their facial expression and emotional
    state \u2014 do they look nervous, confident, angry, scared, calm, evasive? Are
    they making eye contact with the camera or looking away? Are their eyes darting
    around? Do they appear to be sweating, fidgeting, or tense? Note their posture
    \u2014 are they leaning back defensively, sitting forward aggressively, or slouching?
    Note anything they are holding or touching. Describe any notable objects or environment
    visible behind them. Be factual and specific."
